## 📋 Documentation & Versioning

### 🔢 Beta Code Format
**Format**: `25W31a09`
- `25` → Year (2025)
- `W31` → Week of the year (ISO-8601)
- `a` → Beta revision in that week (a, b, c…)
- `09` → Tied to base version (0.9.X)

**Current Version**: `25W32a09` (Next official: `0.9.2a25`)

