## 🔄 Pairing & Track Logic

### 🏁 Advanced Pairing Engine
- **Rematch Avoidance**: Prevent drivers from racing same opponent until all pairings exhausted
- **Lane Optimization**: Assign tracks based on least-used algorithm with diversity scoring
- **Performance Scaling**: Handle large datasets (1000+ participants) with optimized algorithms
- **Free Run Support**: Handle odd participant counts with balanced distribution
- **Class Management**: Prevent overlaps when drivers run in multiple classes

### 🎯 Track Assignment Rules
- Select tracks that driver has used least frequently
- If tied, choose track not used most recently
- Implement points-based assignment system for optimal distribution
- Support multi-lane configurations (2+ lanes)
- Maintain lane diversity across heats

### 🔄 State Management
- **Crash Recovery**: Resume pairing logic from saved state without breaking workflow
- **False Start Handling**: Visual flags must not affect logical placement
- **Event Persistence**: Maintain pairing history across sessions
- **Concurrent Access**: Thread-safe operations for multiple users

